---
import { Image } from "astro:assets"
import MySiteLayout from "@layouts/MySiteLayout.astro"
import buildingImage from "@media/2019/01-001/building.jpg"
---

<MySiteLayout title="375 Park Ave" description="375 Park Ave">
  <body>
    <main>
      <h1>375 PARK AVENUE</h1>
      <Image
        src={buildingImage}
        class="building"
        alt="375 Park Avenue"
        loading="eager"
      />
      <p>
        For firms seeking a significant New York address, this 38-story,
        air-conditioned building, first ever to be sheathed in rich enduring
        bronze and with its own half-acre landscaped plaza, is destined to
        become a business landmark throughout the nation. In architectural
        achievement, advanced installations and interior detailing, 375 Park
        Aveune brings into reality a concept of the office home never before
        attained. Reservations for available upper floors of 11,500 to 13,000
        sq. ft. each are not being considered for late 1957 occupancy. For
        descriptive brochure and plans, write: Renting and Managing Agent,
        <span class="realtor">
          <span class="realtor-logo">Cushman & Wakefield</span>
          <span class="realtor-address"
            >281 Madison Avenue, New York 17, N.Y.</span
          >
        </span>
      </p>

      <footer>
        <span> being built by </span>
        <span class="seagram">THE HOUSE OF SEAGRAM</span>
      </footer>

      <div class="grey-background"></div>
    </main>
  </body>
</MySiteLayout>

<!-- Styling -->
<style>
  * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    background-repeat: no-repeat;

    --cream: #f6efe5;
    --faded-cream: #c0ae95;
    --orange: #f2502a;
    --light-grey: #bebdc2;
    --dark-grey: #323232;
  }
  /* Layout */
  body {
    background-color: var(--light-grey);
    font-family: Avenir, Roboto, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 200;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }
  main {
    margin: 1rem;
    background: var(--cream);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 75fr 215fr 315fr 85fr 75fr;
    grid-template-columns: 75fr 215fr minmax(280px, 315fr) 85fr 75fr;
    grid-template-rows: 75px 65px auto auto auto auto 75px;
    grid-template-rows:
      75px minmax(65px, 1fr) max-content auto auto auto minmax(65px, 1fr)
      75px;
    min-width: 280px;
    min-height: 97vh;
  }
  h1 {
    grid-column: 2 / 5;
    grid-row: 4/5;
    color: var(--cream);
    z-index: 2;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 2.4rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1.4vw;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin: 0.5rem 0.8rem 0.2rem 1.6rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    h1 {
      text-align: right;
    }
  }
  img {
    grid-column: 3/4;
    grid-row: 3/4;
    z-index: 2;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }
  p {
    z-index: 2;
    grid-column: 3/4;
    grid-row: 5/6;
    background: var(--orange);
    margin: 0;
    padding: 1rem;
  }
  p:first-line {
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }
  .realtor {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 80px auto;
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
    grid-gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .realtor-logo {
    background-image: url("../../assets/media/2019/01-001/logo.gif");
    width: 73px;
    height: 20px;
    text-indent: -1000000px;
  }
  .realtor-address {
    align-self: end;
  }
  footer {
    z-index: 2;
    grid-column: 3/4;
    grid-row: 6/7;
    margin: 1rem 0 2rem;
    text-transform: lowercase;
    color: var(--faded-cream);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: max-content auto;
    grid-gap: 0.48rem;
  }
  @media (max-width: 350px) {
    footer {
      margin-left: 1rem;
    }
  }
  .seagram {
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-family: georgia;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    color: var(--cream);
    margin-left: 0.5em;
  }
  .grey-background {
    background-color: var(--dark-grey);
    background-image: url("../../assets/media/2019/01-001/dark-grey-paper.gif");
    background-repeat: repeat;
    grid-column: 2/5;
    grid-row: 2 / -2;
    z-index: 1;
  }
</style>
